  "verseCount": 16,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hagar and Ishmael",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now Sarai, Abram's wife, had borne him no children. But she had an Egyptian slave named Hagar;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "so she said to Abram, \"The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.16.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.16.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has kept me from having children. Go, sleep with my slave; perhaps I can build a family through her.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "GEN 16:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abram agreed to what Sarai said.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So after Abram had been living in Canaan ten years, Sarai his wife took her Egyptian slave Hagar and gave her to her husband to be his wife.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He slept with Hagar, and she conceived.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "GEN 16:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "When she knew she was pregnant, she began to despise her mistress.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Sarai said to Abram, \"You are responsible for the wrong I am suffering. I put my slave in your arms, and now that she knows she is pregnant, she despises me. May the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.16.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.16.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "judge between you and me.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Your slave is in your hands,\" Abram said. \"Do with her whatever you think best.\" Then Sarai mistreated Hagar; so she fled from her.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The angel of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.16.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.16.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "found Hagar near a spring in the desert; it was the spring that is beside the road to Shur.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said, \"Hagar, slave of Sarai, where have you come from, and where are you going?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "GEN 16:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"I'm running away from my mistress Sarai,\" she answered.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the angel of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.16.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.16.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "told her, \"Go back to your mistress and submit to her.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The angel added, \"I will increase your descendants so much that they will be too numerous to count.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The angel of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.16.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.16.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "also said to her:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "GEN 16:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"You are now pregnant",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 16:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and you will give birth to a son.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "GEN 16:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "You shall name him Ishmael,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 16:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "for the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.16.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.16.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has heard of your misery.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He will be a wild donkey of a man;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 16:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "his hand will be against everyone",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 16:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and everyone's hand against him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "GEN 16:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and he will live in hostility",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "GEN 16:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "toward",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "all his brothers.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She gave this name to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.16.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.16.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "who spoke to her: \"You are the God who sees me,\" for she said, \"I have now seen",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "the One who sees me.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That is why the well was called Beer Lahai Roi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; it is still there, between Kadesh and Bered.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Hagar bore Abram a son, and Abram gave the name Ishmael to the son she had borne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abram was eighty-six years old when Hagar bore him Ishmael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
